-### High Frequency Surface Noise Remapping
-Remaps noise value using a range defined by low frequency noise to introduce high frequency detail on cloud surfaces.
-
-### Derivative Erosion FBM
-FBM that accumulates derivatives across octaves, dampening amplitude via `1/(1+|grad|^2)` to create realistic erosion patterns.
